# Terraform working directories
**/.terraform/

# Terraform state files
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*

# Terraform crash logs
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log

# Local override files
**/override.tf
**/override.tf.json
**/*_override.tf
**/*_override.tf.json

# Variable files (often contain secrets or environment-specific values)
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json

# SSH keys and private credentials
**/keys/*
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# OS/editor noise
**/.DS_Store
